     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p>Approved with the following comments:</p>
      <ul>
       <li style=3D"list-style-type: none;">
        <ul>
         <li>User Migration Document Management API must be renamed and rep=
urposed as e.g. an audit log management as the concern is to save files (i.=
e. forms, reports) for audit purposes. (p.s. Documents must be managed by E=
CM)</li>
         <li>The WM AAA board believes the User Migration API might not be =
the most optimal solution given the cost of implementation and operations. =
A typical batch script with MFT mailbox(es) to exchange files would have be=
en a cheaper solution for a common request which is to migrate data. That b=
eing said, the business request is driven by a product vision where standar=
dized interactions are favoured (i.e. Through APIs and UIs)</li>
        </ul></li>
      </ul>
     </div></td>
