<h1 id=3D"MigrateUsers-BusinessContext">Business Context</h1>
<p>Feature:&nbsp;<a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://nbin.aha.io/fea=
tures/IN-135" rel=3D"nofollow">https://nbin.aha.io/features/IN-135</a></p>
<p>Initiative: <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://nbin.aha.io/initi=
atives/CX-S-4" rel=3D"nofollow">https://nbin.aha.io/initiatives/CX-S-4</a><=
/p>
<p>Related epic: <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://nbin.aha.io/epi=
cs/FUM-E-132" rel=3D"nofollow">https://nbin.aha.io/epics/FUM-E-132</a></p>
<p>Design:&nbsp;<a href=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca/display/NWPI/Bulk+User+Migra=
tion+-+Design" rel=3D"nofollow">Bulk User Migration - Design - NBIN - Web P=
latform and IAM - Confluence (bnc.ca)</a></p>
