<h1 id=3D"MigrateUsers-Requirements">Requirements</h1>
<h2 id=3D"MigrateUsers-FunctionalRequirements">Functional Requirements</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 99=
.096%;">
  <colgroup>
   <col style=3D"width: 4.05652%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 95.9674%;">
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">No.</th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Description</th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.001</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p style=3D"text-align: left;"><em>User Migration </em>API must comply=
 to the following principles:</p>
     <ul>
      <li>No business logic implementation</li>
      <li>File validations, as per design=20
       <ul>
        <li><span>File type</span></li>
        <li>File format (i.e. required fields)</li>
        <li><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">Max user limit, as per <=
a href=3D"#MigrateUsers-NFR.001">NFR.001</a></span></li>
       </ul></li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.002</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p style=3D"text-align: left;"><em>User Migration </em>API must have =
the <u><strong>access limited to</strong></u> <em>VDI/VApp &amp; Bulk Uploa=
d </em>script requests only</p>
     </div></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.003</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p style=3D"text-align: left;"><em>User Migration</em> API must provi=
de the following endpoints:</p>
      <div class=3D"table-wrap">
       <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable" data-mce-resize=3D"false">
        <colgroup>
         <col>
         <col>
         <col>
         <col>
        </colgroup>
        <tbody>
         <tr>
          <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Endpoint</th>
          <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Description</th>
          <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">HTTP Request</th>
          <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">HTTP Response</th>
         </tr>
         <tr>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <p>Download template</p></td>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
            Download a migration template
           </div>
           <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
            e.g.
           </div>
           <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
            <ul>
             <li>Compass X migration template (w/o password)</li>
             <li>Compass X migration password template (schema: uuid, passw=
ord)</li>
             <li>DataWarehouse migration template</li>
            </ul>
           </div></td>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
            <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
             <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl" style=3D"border-bott=
om-width: 1px;">
              <b>Request</b>
             </div>
             <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
              <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-p=
arams=3D"brush: java; gutter: true">GET /templates/{template-format} HTTP/1=
.1 </pre>
             </div>
            </div>
           </div></td>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
            <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
             <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl" style=3D"border-bott=
om-width: 1px;">
              <b>Response</b>
             </div>
             <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
              <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-p=
arams=3D"brush: java; gutter: true">HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: text/csv

(content of the template)</pre>
             </div>
            </div>
           </div></td>
         </tr>
         <tr>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <p>Upload template</p></td>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
            Upload a filled out migration template.
           </div>
           <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
            Produces a form and saves it, returning a form id.
           </div>
           <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
            <strong>N.B. </strong>The file content is compliant to the temp=
late format.
           </div></td>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
            <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
             <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl" style=3D"border-bott=
om-width: 1px;">
              <b>Request</b>
             </div>
             <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
              <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-p=
arams=3D"brush: java; gutter: true">POST /templates/{template-format} HTTP/=
1.1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

(content of the file)</pre>
             </div>
            </div>
           </div></td>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
            <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
             <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl" style=3D"border-bott=
om-width: 1px;">
              <b>Response</b>
             </div>
             <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
              <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-p=
arams=3D"brush: java; gutter: true">HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: text/plain

(generated form-id)</pre>
             </div>
            </div>
           </div></td>
         </tr>
         <tr>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <p>Download form</p></td>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
            Download a migration form
           </div></td>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
            <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
             <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl" style=3D"border-bott=
om-width: 1px;">
              <b>Request</b>
             </div>
             <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
              <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-p=
arams=3D"brush: java; gutter: true">GET /forms/{form-id} HTTP/1.1</pre>
             </div>
            </div>
           </div></td>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
            <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
             <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl" style=3D"border-bott=
om-width: 1px;">
              <b>Response</b>
             </div>
             <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
              <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-p=
arams=3D"brush: java; gutter: true">HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: text/csv

(content of the form)</pre>
             </div>
            </div>
           </div></td>
         </tr>
         <tr>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <p>Migrate users</p></td>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <p>Trigger the migration process for a migration form, passing o=
n the user passwords.</p>
           <p>N.B. Passwords must be hashed following bcrypt algorithm</p><=
/td>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
            <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
             <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl" style=3D"border-bott=
om-width: 1px;">
              <b>Request</b>
             </div>
             <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
              <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-p=
arams=3D"brush: java; gutter: true">POST /migrations HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=3D9431149156168
Content-Length: &lt;length&gt;

--9431149156168
Content-Disposition: form-data; name=3D"x-nbin-cx-form-id"

(migration form-id)
--9431149156168
Content-Disposition: form-data; name=3D"file";
Content-Type: text/csv

(content of the password file)
--9431149156168
Content-Disposition: form-data; name=3D"submit"

Start migration process
--9431149156168--
</pre>
             </div>
            </div>
           </div></td>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
            <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl" style=3D"border-botto=
m-width: 1px;">
             <b>Response</b>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
             <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-pa=
rams=3D"brush: java; gutter: true">HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: text/plain

(generated migration-id)</pre>
            </div>
           </div></td>
         </tr>
         <tr>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <p>Get migration progress status</p></td>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Get a migration process' progress stat=
us</td>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
            <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
             <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl" style=3D"border-bott=
om-width: 1px;">
              <b>Request</b>
             </div>
             <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
              <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-p=
arams=3D"brush: java; gutter: true">GET /migrations/{migration-id} HTTP/1.1
</pre>
             </div>
            </div>
           </div></td>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
            <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl" style=3D"border-botto=
m-width: 1px;">
             <b>Response</b>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
             <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-pa=
rams=3D"brush: java; gutter: true">HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: text/plain

(migration status)</pre>
            </div>
           </div></td>
         </tr>
         <tr>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <p>Get report list</p></td>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
            Download the list of migration reports
           </div></td>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
            <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
             <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl" style=3D"border-bott=
om-width: 1px;">
              <b>Request</b>
             </div>
             <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
              <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-p=
arams=3D"brush: java; gutter: true">GET /reports HTTP/1.1 </pre>
             </div>
            </div>
           </div></td>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
            <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
             <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl" style=3D"border-bott=
om-width: 1px;">
              <b>Response</b>
             </div>
             <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
              <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-p=
arams=3D"brush: java; gutter: true">HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: text/plain

{[migration-id: &lt;id&gt;, metadata: [key:value]]}</pre>
             </div>
            </div>
           </div></td>
         </tr>
         <tr>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <p>Download report</p></td>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
            Download a migration report
           </div></td>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
            <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
             <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl" style=3D"border-bott=
om-width: 1px;">
              <b>Request</b>
             </div>
             <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
              <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-p=
arams=3D"brush: java; gutter: true">GET /reports/{migration-id} HTTP/1.1 </=
pre>
             </div>
            </div>
           </div></td>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
            <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
             <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl" style=3D"border-bott=
om-width: 1px;">
              <b>Response</b>
             </div>
             <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
              <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-p=
arams=3D"brush: java; gutter: true">HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: text/csv

(content of the report)</pre>
             </div>
            </div>
           </div></td>
         </tr>
         <tr>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <p>Get report metadata</p></td>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
            Download a migration report's metadata
           </div></td>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
            <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
             <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl" style=3D"border-bott=
om-width: 1px;">
              <b>Request</b>
             </div>
             <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
              <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-p=
arams=3D"brush: java; gutter: true">HEAD /reports/{migration-id} HTTP/1.1 <=
/pre>
             </div>
            </div>
           </div></td>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
            <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
             <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl" style=3D"border-bott=
om-width: 1px;">
              <b>Response</b>
             </div>
             <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
              <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-p=
arams=3D"brush: java; gutter: true">HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: text/plain

{metadata: [key:value]}</pre>
             </div>
            </div>
           </div></td>
         </tr>
        </tbody>
       </table>
      </div>
      <p><br></p>
     </div></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.004</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p style=3D"text-align: left;"><em>Audit Log Management</em> API must=
 provide the following endpoints:</p>
      <div class=3D"table-wrap">
       <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable" data-mce-resize=3D"false">
        <colgroup>
         <col>
         <col>
         <col>
         <col>
        </colgroup>
        <tbody>
         <tr>
          <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Endpoint</th>
          <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Description</th>
          <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">HTTP Request</th>
          <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">HTTP Response</th>
         </tr>
         <tr>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <p>Upload log</p></td>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <p>Upload a file to be logged with metadata</p></td>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
            <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
             <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl" style=3D"border-bott=
om-width: 1px;">
              <b>Request</b>
             </div>
             <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
              <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-p=
arams=3D"brush: java; gutter: true">POST /logs HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=3D9431149156168
Content-Length: &lt;length&gt;

--9431149156168
Content-Disposition: form-data; name=3D"x-nbin-cx-meta-&lt;key&gt;"

(metadata value)
--9431149156168
Content-Disposition: form-data; name=3D"file";
Content-Type: text/csv

(file content)
--9431149156168
Content-Disposition: form-data; name=3D"submit"

Upload document
--9431149156168--</pre>
             </div>
            </div>
           </div></td>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
            <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
             <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl" style=3D"border-bott=
om-width: 1px;">
              <b>Response</b>
             </div>
             <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
              <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-p=
arams=3D"brush: java; gutter: true">HTTP/1.1 201 Created
Content-Type: text/plain

(generated log-id)</pre>
             </div>
            </div>
           </div></td>
         </tr>
         <tr>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <p>Download log</p></td>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <p>Download a logged file</p></td>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
            <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
             <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl" style=3D"border-bott=
om-width: 1px;">
              <b>Request</b>
             </div>
             <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
              <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-p=
arams=3D"brush: java; gutter: true">GET /logs/{log-id} HTTP/1.1 </pre>
             </div>
            </div>
           </div></td>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
            <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
             <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl" style=3D"border-bott=
om-width: 1px;">
              <b>Response</b>
             </div>
             <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
              <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-p=
arams=3D"brush: java; gutter: true">HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: text/csv

(content of the log file)</pre>
             </div>
            </div>
           </div></td>
         </tr>
         <tr>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <p>Get log metadata</p></td>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <p>Get a logged file's metadata</p></td>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
            <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
             <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl" style=3D"border-bott=
om-width: 1px;">
              <b>Request</b>
             </div>
             <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
              <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-p=
arams=3D"brush: java; gutter: true">HEAD /logs/{log-id} HTTP/1.1 </pre>
             </div>
            </div>
           </div></td>
          <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
           <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
            <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
             <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl" style=3D"border-bott=
om-width: 1px;">
              <b>Response</b>
             </div>
             <div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
              <pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-p=
arams=3D"brush: java; gutter: true">HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Content-Type: text/plain

{metadata: [key:value]}</pre>
             </div>
            </div>
           </div></td>
         </tr>
        </tbody>
       </table>
      </div>
      <p><br></p>
     </div></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.005</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p style=3D"text-align: left;"><em>Audit Log Management</em> API must=
 have the logs saved in the <em>PostgreSQL</em> database as <em>bytea</em> =
data type, as we are not dealing with large objects.</p>
      <p style=3D"text-align: left;">Ref. <a class=3D"external-link" href=
=3D"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/7.4/jdbc-binary-data.html" rel=3D"nofol=
low">PostgreSQL: Documentation: 7.4: Storing Binary Data</a></p>
     </div></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.006</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p style=3D"text-align: left;">A form can be migrated only once</p>
     </div></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-r=
ef=3D"7a84e6c6-a586-48f6-94f1-b7e0ced1ba35">FR.007</span></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p>User Configuration API must handle the following, as per design:</=
p>
      <ul>
       <li style=3D"text-align: left;">Syntax validations (<a href=3D"https=
://wiki.bnc.ca/display/NWPI/Bulk+User+Migration+-+Design#BulkUserMigrationD=
esign-PerformSyntaxValidation" rel=3D"nofollow">link</a>)</li>
       <li style=3D"text-align: left;">Syntax corrections (<a href=3D"https=
://wiki.bnc.ca/display/NWPI/Bulk+User+Migration+-+Design#BulkUserMigrationD=
esign-PerformSyntaxCorrection" rel=3D"nofollow">link</a>)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>UI changes:</p>
      <ul>
       <li style=3D"color:#c9372c;"><span style=3D"color:#c9372c;">TBD (ref=
. Owen)</span></li>
      </ul>
     </div></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.008</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p style=3D"text-align: left;">Modify the Create User API endpoint to=
 account for the syntax validation &amp; correction option.</p>
      <div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
       <div class=3D"codeHeader panelHeader pdl" style=3D"border-bottom-wid=
