<h2 id=3D"MigrateUsers-SecurityRequirements">Security Requirements</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 98=
.9831%;">
  <colgroup>
   <col style=3D"width: 4.67312%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 95.2982%;">
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">No.</th>
    <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Description</th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">SR.001</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Data must not be stored and handled on personal desktop equipment.&=
nbsp;</p>
     <p>Ref.&nbsp;<strong style=3D"text-decoration: none;"><a class=3D"exte=
rnal-link" href=3D"https://cbncnbccs.sharepoint.com/sites/securite/SitePage=
s/en/Norme-protection-donnees.aspx?xsdata=3DMDV8MDF8fDRhNTg3OTUzNGIyMzQ2Mzl=
jNjAwMDhkYmYyODVkMThmfGMyMTE1N2NhYmNlMzQxYTg4YWE3YTIzYzQ2Mzk2MTBhfDB8MHw2Mz=
gzNzA0Mjg3NjM0ODk3OTJ8VW5rbm93bnxWR1ZoYlhOVFpXTjFjbWwwZVZObGNuWnBZMlY4ZXlKV=
0lqb2lNQzR3TGpBd01EQWlMQ0pRSWpvaVYybHVNeklpTENKQlRpSTZJazkwYUdWeUlpd2lWMVFp=
T2pFeGZRPT18MXxMMk5vWVhSekx6RTVPak5oTXpKaU9UTmlMVE14TVdRdE5EZGtZeTA1WmpVMEx=
URmhaR1U0WVRVNFlXVTBNbDltT1dFd1pUY3paQzA0TURCbUxUUmxNamd0WVdWak1pMDNNREV5TV=
RKa01tRmxNelJBZFc1eExtZGliQzV6Y0dGalpYTXZiV1Z6YzJGblpYTXZNVGN3TVRRME5qQTNOV=
El3TUE9PXxmNTMwZjNhM2Y1OTc0NjA3YzYwMDA4ZGJmMjg1ZDE4Znw5MWI3NmNiYTBiZjM0YzUy=
YjM2MjdjNTIzMjUzYTBlNg%3d%3d&amp;sdata=3DbGpudGFTcGV4eXJBRi85Y3ZJZitoRUw4TD=
k4Sm1BdHdzcWkrVVJIU1NIST0%3d&amp;ovuser=3Dc21157ca-bce3-41a8-8aa7-a23c46396=
10a%2cjosephpascal.pierre%40bnc.ca&amp;OR=3DTeams-HL&amp;CT=3D1701446081397=
&amp;clickparams=3DeyJBcHBOYW1lIjoiVGVhbXMtRGVza3RvcCIsIkFwcFZlcnNpb24iOiIy=
OC8yMzA5MjkxMTIwOCIsIkhhc0ZlZGVyYXRlZFVzZXIiOmZhbHNlfQ%3d%3d&amp;SafelinksU=
rl=3Dhttps%3a%2f%2fcbncnbccs.sharepoint.com%2fsites%2fsecurite%2fSitePages%=
2fNorme-protection-donnees.aspx" rel=3D"nofollow">PDD-TDS-01</a></strong></=
p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">SR.002</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Access to and handling of data must take place from a secured envir=
onment separate from the workstation.</p>
     <p>Ref.&nbsp;<strong style=3D"text-decoration: none;"><a class=3D"exte=
rnal-link" href=3D"https://cbncnbccs.sharepoint.com/sites/securite/SitePage=
s/en/Norme-protection-donnees.aspx?xsdata=3DMDV8MDF8fDRhNTg3OTUzNGIyMzQ2Mzl=
jNjAwMDhkYmYyODVkMThmfGMyMTE1N2NhYmNlMzQxYTg4YWE3YTIzYzQ2Mzk2MTBhfDB8MHw2Mz=
gzNzA0Mjg3NjM0ODk3OTJ8VW5rbm93bnxWR1ZoYlhOVFpXTjFjbWwwZVZObGNuWnBZMlY4ZXlKV=
0lqb2lNQzR3TGpBd01EQWlMQ0pRSWpvaVYybHVNeklpTENKQlRpSTZJazkwYUdWeUlpd2lWMVFp=
T2pFeGZRPT18MXxMMk5vWVhSekx6RTVPak5oTXpKaU9UTmlMVE14TVdRdE5EZGtZeTA1WmpVMEx=
URmhaR1U0WVRVNFlXVTBNbDltT1dFd1pUY3paQzA0TURCbUxUUmxNamd0WVdWak1pMDNNREV5TV=
RKa01tRmxNelJBZFc1eExtZGliQzV6Y0dGalpYTXZiV1Z6YzJGblpYTXZNVGN3TVRRME5qQTNOV=
El3TUE9PXxmNTMwZjNhM2Y1OTc0NjA3YzYwMDA4ZGJmMjg1ZDE4Znw5MWI3NmNiYTBiZjM0YzUy=
YjM2MjdjNTIzMjUzYTBlNg%3d%3d&amp;sdata=3DbGpudGFTcGV4eXJBRi85Y3ZJZitoRUw4TD=
k4Sm1BdHdzcWkrVVJIU1NIST0%3d&amp;ovuser=3Dc21157ca-bce3-41a8-8aa7-a23c46396=
10a%2cjosephpascal.pierre%40bnc.ca&amp;OR=3DTeams-HL&amp;CT=3D1701446081397=
&amp;clickparams=3DeyJBcHBOYW1lIjoiVGVhbXMtRGVza3RvcCIsIkFwcFZlcnNpb24iOiIy=
OC8yMzA5MjkxMTIwOCIsIkhhc0ZlZGVyYXRlZFVzZXIiOmZhbHNlfQ%3d%3d&amp;SafelinksU=
rl=3Dhttps%3a%2f%2fcbncnbccs.sharepoint.com%2fsites%2fsecurite%2fSitePages%=
2fNorme-protection-donnees.aspx" rel=3D"nofollow">PDD-TDS-04</a></strong>&n=
bsp;</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">SR.003</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Data at rest must be protected by using a data protection mechanism=
 (e.g. encryption, tokenization, one-way hashing, ...)</p>
     <p>Ref.&nbsp;<strong style=3D"text-decoration: none;"><a class=3D"exte=
rnal-link" href=3D"https://cbncnbccs.sharepoint.com/sites/securite/SitePage=
s/en/Norme-protection-donnees.aspx?xsdata=3DMDV8MDF8fDRhNTg3OTUzNGIyMzQ2Mzl=
jNjAwMDhkYmYyODVkMThmfGMyMTE1N2NhYmNlMzQxYTg4YWE3YTIzYzQ2Mzk2MTBhfDB8MHw2Mz=
gzNzA0Mjg3NjM0ODk3OTJ8VW5rbm93bnxWR1ZoYlhOVFpXTjFjbWwwZVZObGNuWnBZMlY4ZXlKV=
0lqb2lNQzR3TGpBd01EQWlMQ0pRSWpvaVYybHVNeklpTENKQlRpSTZJazkwYUdWeUlpd2lWMVFp=
T2pFeGZRPT18MXxMMk5vWVhSekx6RTVPak5oTXpKaU9UTmlMVE14TVdRdE5EZGtZeTA1WmpVMEx=
URmhaR1U0WVRVNFlXVTBNbDltT1dFd1pUY3paQzA0TURCbUxUUmxNamd0WVdWak1pMDNNREV5TV=
RKa01tRmxNelJBZFc1eExtZGliQzV6Y0dGalpYTXZiV1Z6YzJGblpYTXZNVGN3TVRRME5qQTNOV=
El3TUE9PXxmNTMwZjNhM2Y1OTc0NjA3YzYwMDA4ZGJmMjg1ZDE4Znw5MWI3NmNiYTBiZjM0YzUy=
YjM2MjdjNTIzMjUzYTBlNg%3d%3d&amp;sdata=3DbGpudGFTcGV4eXJBRi85Y3ZJZitoRUw4TD=
k4Sm1BdHdzcWkrVVJIU1NIST0%3d&amp;ovuser=3Dc21157ca-bce3-41a8-8aa7-a23c46396=
10a%2cjosephpascal.pierre%40bnc.ca&amp;OR=3DTeams-HL&amp;CT=3D1701446081397=
&amp;clickparams=3DeyJBcHBOYW1lIjoiVGVhbXMtRGVza3RvcCIsIkFwcFZlcnNpb24iOiIy=
OC8yMzA5MjkxMTIwOCIsIkhhc0ZlZGVyYXRlZFVzZXIiOmZhbHNlfQ%3d%3d&amp;SafelinksU=
rl=3Dhttps%3a%2f%2fcbncnbccs.sharepoint.com%2fsites%2fsecurite%2fSitePages%=
2fNorme-protection-donnees.aspx" rel=3D"nofollow">PDD-SDD-01, PDD-SDD-02</a=
></strong></p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">SR.004</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Data must be encrypted in transit.</p>
     <p>Ref.&nbsp;<strong style=3D"text-decoration: none;"><a class=3D"exte=
rnal-link" href=3D"https://cbncnbccs.sharepoint.com/sites/securite/SitePage=
s/en/Norme-protection-donnees.aspx?xsdata=3DMDV8MDF8fDRhNTg3OTUzNGIyMzQ2Mzl=
jNjAwMDhkYmYyODVkMThmfGMyMTE1N2NhYmNlMzQxYTg4YWE3YTIzYzQ2Mzk2MTBhfDB8MHw2Mz=
gzNzA0Mjg3NjM0ODk3OTJ8VW5rbm93bnxWR1ZoYlhOVFpXTjFjbWwwZVZObGNuWnBZMlY4ZXlKV=
